    <string name="scheme_guide_title">How to design a good scheme</string>
    <string name="scheme_guide_step_1">1. Start from official curriculum outcomes for the class and term.</string>
    <string name="scheme_guide_step_2">2. Break the term into realistic weekly topics and objectives.</string>
    <string name="scheme_guide_step_3">3. Plan learner-centred activities and practical work per week.</string>
    <string name="scheme_guide_step_4">4. List references/resources (including updated NCDC links).</string>
    <string name="scheme_guide_step_5">5. Add clear assessment criteria for each planned week.</string>
